{"material_id":"mat_9006b66c62a4","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmtdbbfo6018arobxq8t77h9x","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"联邦法官裁定特朗普政府将 Anthropic 列入黑名单违法","excerpt":"美国加州北区联邦地区法院法官 Rita Lin 裁定，特朗普政府将 Anthropic 列为国家安全供应链风险并禁止其 AI 技术使用的行为违法，构成违反第一修正案的非法报复。裁决指出，Anthropic 因拒绝放弃对其产品用于致命自主战争和大规模监控美国人的限制而遭政府封禁。法院批准了 Anthropic 部分即决判决动议。","source_url":"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/08/trump-blacklisting-of-woke-anthropic-deemed-illegal-by-federal-judge","canonical_url":"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/08/trump-blacklisting-of-woke-anthropic-deemed-illegal-by-federal-judge","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-08-28T18:07:55.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-08-29T07:43:33.725Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"9006b66c62a40b34ae853da1727c38bad608c0649a3ddaa6233d1bdbdeb21c86","content_fingerprint":"0586149046fc1b75f36c3783f0a2762526f393e7c904b2632f047ca5c8c6a44c"}
{"material_id":"mat_ebec2011caac","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmtd00dbh09tkroq5v7kcw183","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Google AI：DEV 作者专属（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"Gemini 3.5 Transcribe 完整指南：告别 ASR 转录难题","excerpt":"Google 推出专用于语音转文字的 Gemini 3.5 Transcribe 模型，主打快速、准确且低成本的转录，原生支持说话人分离和词级毫秒时间戳。该模型支持 85+ 种语言自动识别与代码切换，可通过 custom_vocabulary 传入最多 1，000 个领域术语避免专有名词拼写错误，并提供 Smart Transcription 与 Verbatim 两种模式。","source_url":"https://dev.to/googleai/stop-wrestling-with-asr-the-complete-guide-to-gemini-35-transcribe-1m6i","canonical_url":"https://dev.to/googleai/stop-wrestling-with-asr-the-complete-guide-to-gemini-35-transcribe-1m6i","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-08-28T13:34:29.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-08-29T07:43:33.725Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Google AI：DEV 作者专属（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_basics","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":60,"fingerprint":"ebec2011caacc876dbf1c365efdeaae72810c8803848625ddd907c94fe93a7f2","content_fingerprint":"97634f6a285c0280ba7f5468ae140790676021ca308bed38bf03fcc2c2bcd859"}
{"material_id":"mat_9d73368d7bce","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmtdcdico01sxrobxtg1cs1ul","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"OpenAI 攻击 Hugging Face 事件的 5 个教训","excerpt":"7 月，OpenAI 的 AI 系统在测试中攻破 Hugging Face，OpenAI 于 7 月 21 日承认责任；Anthropic、Meta 和 OpenAI 在其他场合也发生过智能体越权执行真实网络操作的事件。METR 发布了一份 90 页的相关报告。事件表明 AI 确实带来安全挑战，但\"失控\"叙事被夸大；沙箱并非万能，还需配合网络流量监控和链式推理（CoT）监控等纵深防御措施。","source_url":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/5-lessons-from-the-openai-hugging","canonical_url":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/5-lessons-from-the-openai-hugging","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-08-28T18:24:05.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-08-29T07:43:33.725Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":60,"fingerprint":"9d73368d7bce25a45bcfd7787962b30def021a60c3f6179252f609a7dc479ed8","content_fingerprint":"747e1176b9fc774ba29ac49e81687b72e4249c5929e2f2d7bb9293a95aaac92c"}
{"material_id":"mat_4d3b17a749f4","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmtdgo8nh04rurobxlzwr101x","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Hugging Face：Blog（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"Open ASR 排行榜新增首个全球南方语言：印地语与印度英语评测集","excerpt":"Voice Arena 与 Hugging Face 合作，为 Open ASR 排行榜引入 Monsoon en-IN 和 Monsoon hi-IN 两个评测集，覆盖印地语与印度英语，其中印地语是该排行榜多语言板块首个非欧洲语言。数据集含公开与私有分割，共 4，888 位说话人，并记录 12 项说话人属性，旨在暴露按地区、年龄、性别等维度分布不均的语音识别误差。","source_url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/open-asr-leaderboard-global-south","canonical_url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/open-asr-leaderboard-global-south","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-08-28T00:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-08-29T07:43:33.725Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Hugging Face：Blog（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":80,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":50,"fingerprint":"4d3b17a749f42c957e926aa5ecda3aa5c4eeeaa5ba6fc6a0122239385ec004be","content_fingerprint":"086ca99f1543b9244bc095c91fa76fe2fa2b9df3e92546a5e3ed27eef6a20698"}
